Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Main,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Fin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:09.93,sign_52_1_Kunahama_High_2n,Signs,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(289,1)}Kunahama High 2nd Year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:09.93,sign_52_2_Kurashina_Asuka,Signs,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(289,1)}Kurashina Asuka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:05.91,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the All-Japan Flying \NCircus Fall Tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.29,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,We are moments away from the final \Nof the West Kyushu qualifiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:11.14,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,which has the Free-Spirited \NFlying Fish, Kurashina Asuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:14.50,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,going up against the Summer \NAll-Japan Champion, Inui Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:14.49,School,Sign,0001,0346,0048,,{\fad(745,1)}Kunahama High 2nd Year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:14.49,Name,Sign,0001,0426,0021,,{\fad(745,1)}Kurashina Asuka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:14.49,School,Sign,0324,0001,0134,,{\an2}{\fad(745,1)}Kairyou Academy 2nd Year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:14.49,Name,Sign,0500,0001,0106,,{\an2}{\fad(745,1)}Inui Saki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:20.64,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody could've predicted Kurashina \Nmaking it all the way to the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.23,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows what this match \Nhas in store for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.01,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give it my all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.30,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:37.23,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I will not stand for another \Ngame like the semifinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:41.03,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,You must fly with grace \Nand silence your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.67,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:47.74,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,I'll put on a perfect display of our FC.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:51.52,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,An absolutely perfect one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:54.20,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:57.43,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:08.49,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have a good game, Inui-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:14.31,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't have made it this \Nfar without losing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.75,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,My weak, no-good self
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:21.52,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,got plunged into the fires of hell, \Nand then rose from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.33,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Like in {\i1}Zephyrion{\i0}, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.36,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:26.58,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:28.50,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.23,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,This match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:33.37,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,won't go anything like the \None against the zipzap girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:34.80,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,You'd best be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:37.04,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.39,0:01:39.11,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I am ready to have a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:40.57,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,"Have a blast"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:41.93,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:43.41,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:45.98,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Flying is just so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.18,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,You enjoy it too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:51.81,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,On your marks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:58.00,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:33.88,Episode-Title,Title,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(311,1)}Episode Twelve:\N "Let's... Soar Higher!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.61,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go. The final is underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.69,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Both players are start off \Nusing low yo-yos to speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.28,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Inui, a speeder, has pulled ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.27,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, she's quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:43.61,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,She overtook Asuka-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.60,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san really is quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:47.03,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Don't hold back, Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:48.45,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Push the pedal to the metal \Nright from the get-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.31,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.10,Main,Ar,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! Three straight Sonic Boosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:58.34,Main,Ga,0000,0000,0000,,She's being awfully aggressive \Nthis early in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.17,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki. Shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:00.92,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:06.64,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina! 1-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:10.22,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,For the first time this tournament, Inui \Nhas lost the race to the second buoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.81,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I have the upper hand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.64,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,This takes the Birdcage out of the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.14,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,That's so like Kurashina-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:18.40,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka! Keep going and slip past her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.07,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:38.54,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.59,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:40.75,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Pentagram Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:45.68,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my! Her maneuvers are drawing \Na five-pointed star in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.35,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pentagram!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:49.35,Main,Ri,0000,0000,0000,,She modified the Delta Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.80,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,Pentagram... Force...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.94,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,What an awesome name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.02,Main,Ri,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:58.06,Italics,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Way to go in guns blazing, Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.44,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,She practiced this a whole lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:02.57,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:04.82,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,This move...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.89,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I came up with it so I could \Nface you on equal footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:08.65,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:10.81,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,If we figure out the pattern, \Nwe can predict where she'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:11.58,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.00,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Irina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.46,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:20.85,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're tie—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.56,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina! 2-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:30.57,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,That's it, Kurashina! That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:32.31,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Use the recoil to take the third buoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.31,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:36.69,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina has amazingly taken \Na two-point lead over Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:39.31,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,But Inui instantly made a \Nbeeline for the next buoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:41.46,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't dwell on it at all. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.32,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Take a shortcut to the third line!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.28,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.43,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui! 2-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:50.57,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.84,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Get your payback on the third line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:54.29,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.12,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:05:59.79,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.83,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,She's evading all her attacks by a whisker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:10.72,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.99,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like the last time I played her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.36,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,She's enjoying this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:34.17,Main,Loli,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.91,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,All that practice is paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:39.09,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Those three-on-one drills \Nhelped prepare her for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:44.30,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Inui's unleashing a barrage of attacks, \Nbut Kurashina's dodging all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.90,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's the way, Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:47.26,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Stay alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.20,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:51.89,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.26,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Mashiro-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:54.88,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Madoka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:55.89,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.46,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Rika-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:58.75,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Satouin-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:06:59.89,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Shindou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:02.76,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,And Kagami-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.15,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,And Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.44,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,She evaded every last one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:08.88,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Above you, Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.79,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to hit her with all \Nthe hopes you entrusted to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.79,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hyper...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:18.50,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Low Yo-Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.04,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina! 3-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:27.25,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,She scored! That's Kurashina's third point!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:30.91,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.10,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,There are three minutes left in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:41.19,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Three minutes is all that stands \Nbetween Asuka and victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:43.55,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.52,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Turn off your balancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:46.27,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:47.80,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Phase first...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.67,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Fifty percent unl—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:49.23,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:51.36,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,One-hundred percent unlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.07,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:56.95,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.78,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Agravain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.44,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Phase second...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.45,0:08:05.67,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:09.14,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Complete balancer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.02,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,unlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.77,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:16.61,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,It is time for silence to descend upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.45,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,She tweaked the balancer on her Grav-Shoes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.36,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.19,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,She cut it off completely!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:29.92,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Can you even do that in-flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:31.53,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Avalon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:34.68,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,They entered the market only a few years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:37.20,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,but they've already developed \Nthat kind of technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.52,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:43.41,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Turning off the balancer, \Nwhich acts as a safety device,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.74,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,would make you unable to maintain \Nyour balance in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.00,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,But control your Grav-Shoes in that state,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:53.49,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,and you'll be able to use them \Nto their fullest capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.04,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it's possible \Nto control them that perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.39,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,She must have extraordinary \Nstamina and reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:07.83,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:09.44,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Use Sonic Boost to put \Nsome daylight between you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:11.32,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,And then go for the buoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:12.03,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:13.94,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:18.95,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:23.22,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui! 3-3!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.82,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:28.80,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:32.17,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Proceed to Greensleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.22,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Show them how beautiful you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.65,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.04,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world is that move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.03,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.90,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Do something, anything to get free!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.11,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:10:00.87,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,That's the perfect closed world \N we created together with Avalon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:04.76,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to the pin-drop silence that \Nhas befallen the entire venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:08.10,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,This is Avalon's symphony!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.39,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.89,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,T-Time has run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:30.04,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Since the match has ended in a 3-3 draw,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.77,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,we will now have a ten-minute break,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.40,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,and then extra time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:43.22,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Extra time after a draw in regulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:46.14,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,The finale to our FC is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:47.66,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,A chance like this does \Nnot come around often,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:50.67,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,so we arranged a little \Ncurtain call of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:54.45,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Five minutes in which we toy \Nwith our powerless opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:58.78,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Five minutes of perfect silence and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:08.42,Main,h,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.06,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:10.64,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.69,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.46,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.78,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Those "Agravain" Grav-Shoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:23.62,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Their balancer parameters can be \Nfreely tweaked during a match, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:27.75,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,And then we have Inui-kun, who \Nhas the ability to control
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:29.74,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,those Grav-Shoes at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.43,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Shindou-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:37.09,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,So even the King of Kings doesn't \Nhave a solution to this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.01,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.72,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,As much as I hate to admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.60,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,But Kurashina-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:50.81,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I think Kurashina-san is amazing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.44,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.27,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:57.19,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,We still don't know the \Nlimits of her ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:01.24,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,She might still have major \Npotential hidden away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.20,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:08.04,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,She might show us something \Neven more entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.42,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.21,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,You are all right, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.72,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Things don't look all right over there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:26.76,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't seem likely to last \Nthe five minutes of extra time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.97,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Just a bit more...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:32.60,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could've flown \Nwith her just a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.94,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,With Kurashina Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.15,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:43.82,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:46.16,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any HP left, Asuka-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:47.91,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.29,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's incredible she can fly so freely \Nafter turning off her balancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:56.54,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san keeps soaring ever higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.55,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,This match is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:01.84,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.43,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:05.13,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.26,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to turn off my balancer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.31,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,That's reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:14.81,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you remember how you couldn't fly \Nat all the last time you tried that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:15.94,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.81,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, your Grav-Shoes \Naren't like Avalon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.32,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,You can't calibrate them mid-flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.07,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Once you turn the balancer \Noff, there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:24.99,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Do you still want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:26.99,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want this to be the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:30.53,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to keep flying with Inui-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.66,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.83,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if I get burned to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.33,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,We care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:40.42,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You're not Zephyrion, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:41.92,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.72,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,She might just become the \NMaster of the Heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:48.09,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Not you too, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:52.51,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Let's trust Asuka on this, Masaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:54.60,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.69,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:13:59.15,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave everything to Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.27,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I will, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.90,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you, Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.28,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.07,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:08.07,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Me three, Kurashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:08.95,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.08,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Did you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:18.17,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Our FC, and the perfect \Nsilence it brings about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.83,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,It was the same back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.80,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Accompanying the beautiful \Nspectacle you put on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.80,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,was a deafening silence in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.80,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,That was just fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:34.68,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Two athletes putting their skills to \Nthe test, competing against each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:37.60,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,and bringing joy to both the \Nplayers and the audience...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.81,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,That's what the sport of \NFlying Circus is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:45.03,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,If it were simply about overwhelming \None's opponent to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.69,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,its name wouldn't include the word "Circus."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:54.45,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait to see whether you can say \Nthe same thing after extra time ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:59.29,Italics,PA,0000,0000,0000,,The extra time period in the \Nfinal will begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:00.33,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:03.42,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time in this tournament \Nthat a match has gone into extra time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.55,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Extra time will last five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:08.67,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,If a winner isn't decided within \Nthat time, we'll go to sudden death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:11.26,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't run away, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:15.18,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I applaud your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:24.57,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:27.32,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fly with you all the \Nway this time, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:30.45,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,On your marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:34.70,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.33,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:46.63,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't even have the energy \Nto fly straight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:47.88,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:58.14,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Two silhouettes soared through the skies
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:56.06,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Her Grav-Shoes' wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.35,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you turned off...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:04.69,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Spreading the wings on their backs wide
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:15:59.98,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,...the balancer, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.31,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,So I could fly with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:03.65,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.27,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you can stay in control!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.02,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:09.90,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.41,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.28,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,She actually has her shoes under control?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.24,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.54,Italics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Go straight for the third buoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:20.16,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.29,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,Mind-boggling. There's no \Nother way to describe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:25.88,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki! Go after her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:26.88,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:31.51,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking about it won't get me anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:34.93,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,I know it can't go on like this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:34.93,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Take a shortcut, Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:35.51,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:40.72,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina! 5-3!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:43.10,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Holy cow! This is beyond unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:43.10,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Does having more obstacles make one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:47.48,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,In a matter of seconds, Kurashina \Ngot her Grav-Shoes under control
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:47.23,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Strive even harder? Round and Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.23,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,and took a two-point lead over Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.95,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,You can do this, Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:57.78,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Let's race
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.41,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.78,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,This has turned into one crazy match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.03,Main,Ri,0000,0000,0000,,It really has.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:03.54,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,To the vapor trail
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.50,Main,Kaz,0000,0000,0000,,With this, the sport of \NFC will evolve once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.42,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Players will be freed from \Nthe shackles of balancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.58,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Beyond the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:13.22,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,You soared through the skies \Nwith a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.63,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,It's the dawn of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.80,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:18.85,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I need to fly \Nhigher and farther than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.39,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Use Greensleeves again to pin her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:19.18,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:21.72,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The summer breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:20.68,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:27.06,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Carries the scent of the sea \Nand all your voices to me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.23,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,What's this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:28.44,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.56,0:17:32.32,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,And gives me the wings \Nof courage I need to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:32.36,Italics,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like my body's burning up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:33.90,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:36.66,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:39.28,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,"Have a blast"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.16,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.16,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let me show you how, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:46.29,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Your softly spoken words
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.84,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,And your fleeting gaze
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.22,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:58.26,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Make me want more
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:57.63,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,5-4!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:17:59.14,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.97,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Please keep your eyes on me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.97,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san's expression changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.77,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,She seems full of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:12.86,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Let's fight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:09.36,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Kurashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.65,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,6-4!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.86,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Asuka-chan seems to be having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:13.78,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:18.45,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Wearing our hearts on our sleeves
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.15,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Inui-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.41,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's soar even higher...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:21.41,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Beyond the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:20.62,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:28.25,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,You soar through the skies \Nwith a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:25.75,Main,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:33.88,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I need to fly \Nhigher and farther today
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.55,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen Saki beaming \Nlike that during a match before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.84,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,As a new day dawns upon us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.51,0:18:35.84,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.05,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,6-5!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:42.51,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Show me once again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:47.52,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The wings of courage I need to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.10,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.23,Main,G,0000,0000,0000,,6-6!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:49.40,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,We're all tied up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:52.15,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Not long left to go now in extra time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.96,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:14.71,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Coming to a standstill
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.50,Italics,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.92,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.05,Main,Haruki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:17.88,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,How dazzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.72,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,I see above me a sky so high
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.26,Main,Ri,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I can't take my eyes off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:24.47,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Their contrails...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:26.60,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,If we can't go it alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.06,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:28.89,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,How very unsightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:33.19,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go together
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.35,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,They're merely chasing \Nafter each other endlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:33.73,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,and competing to see who's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:37.82,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Wings on the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:36.28,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:38.53,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,It's so,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:45.95,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,You soared through the skies \Nwith a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.57,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:49.62,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This sight is beyond \Nanyone's wildest imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:52.08,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I need to fly \Nhigher and farther than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.75,Main,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,so I hope you'll forgive me \Nfor being speechless there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:54.38,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,but the five minutes of extra \Ntime have already passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:54.96,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,The summer breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:57.42,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Now, whoever scores the next point wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:20:00.22,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Carries the scent of the sea \Nand all your voices to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.76,Song,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,And gives me the wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.97,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,She lost control?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.81,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Inui's gonna touch her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:13.15,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Was it no good after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:15.69,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:18.94,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:24.74,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:35.00,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,P-Point to Kurashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:38.42,Italics,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina wins, 7-6!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:48.93,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:52.23,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you? You went and won!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.02,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations, champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.94,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Champion...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.44,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.24,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:11.70,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for fulfilling my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:12.66,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,You're crying too much, Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:16.29,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,You won, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:17.71,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.13,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:21.76,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,But, more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:25.55,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:30.93,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I concede.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:36.69,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,All these years, I've wanted your \Napproval because I admired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:40.52,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,But perhaps I went about it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.78,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:46.74,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,I always thought I'd made a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:50.83,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,But now that I know it played a big \Npart in broadening FC's horizons,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:53.95,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,a weight's been lifted off my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:03.30,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I think I understand the significance \Nof the word "Circus" a little now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:09.30,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,Flying Circus is a fun sport that brings \Njoy to people's hearts, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:11.72,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:13.06,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.52,Main,Ir,0000,0000,0000,,As much as I hate to admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:42.81,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
